{
    // =================================================================
    // The profiles, their ports and databases: docs/local-development.md
    //
    // Every config is a thin pointer to a launchSettings.json profile —
    // the single source of truth for env vars, connection strings, ports,
    // and AWS mode. Edit profiles in:
    //   IniaAi.WebApp/Properties/launchSettings.json
    //   IniaAi.WebApi/Properties/launchSettings.json
    // (git-ignored; regenerate from the launchSettings.example.json files)
    // =================================================================
